                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Mr. Hart.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September 8,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hill directs Mr. Hart to notify the new Government of his readiness to enter
                    into relations when it is in possession of the machinery of administration, is
                    maintaining order, executing the laws of Colombia with the general assent of the
                    people, and responsibly fulfilling international obligations.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
